e,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["android","app-framework","cross-platform","ios","mobile","mobile-development","react","react-native"],"visibility":"public","forks":25122,"open_issues":1240,"watchers":125547,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/pulls/24058","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/24058","diff_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/24058.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/pull/24058.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!-- Thanks for submitting a pull request! We appreciate you spending the time to work on these changes. Please provide enough information so that others can review your pull request. The three fields below are mandatory. -->\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the case where the content a VirtualizedList loads with a contentLength of 0,  causing a crash in the `renderDebugOverlay` function. The result of that crash is a red screen when turning on debug on FlatList and other VirtualizedList components as described in #24053.\r\n\r\n<!-- Explain the **motivation** for making this change. What existing problem does the pull request solve? -->\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n\r\n<!-- Help reviewers and the release process by writing your own changelog entry. See http://facebook.github.io/react-native/docs/contributing#changelog for an example. -->\r\n[LIST] [FIX] - Fix VirtualizedList debug mode crash\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\nThis code will reproduce the problem:\r\n```\r\nimport React, { Component } from 'react'\r\nimport { Text, FlatList } from 'react-native'\r\n\r\nexport default class App extends Component {\r\n  render() {\r\n    return (\r\n      <FlatList\r\n        //  ❌ Un-commit this line to see error\r\n        debug={true}\r\n        data={[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}\r\n        renderItem={_ => {\r\n          return <Text>123</Text>\r\n        }}\r\n        keyExtractor={item => item.toString()}\r\n      />\r\n    )\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"429\" alt=\"Screenshot 2019-03-20 at 07 54 34\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1605731/54667910-7f95ca00-4ae5-11e9-8002-cd97129a8d82.png\">\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"411\" alt=\"Screenshot 2019-03-20 at 07 54 59\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1605731/54667926-86244180-4ae5-11e9-944e-b0081b51e353.png\">\r\n\r\n<!-- Demonstrate the code is solid. Example: The exact commands you ran and their output, screenshots / videos if the pull request changes UI. -->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24058/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24058/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/474724772","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/24053#issuecomment-474724772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24053","id":474724772,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ3NDcyNDc3Mg==","user":{"login":"bartolkaruza","id":1605731,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDU3MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1605731?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bartolkaruza","html_url":"https://github.com/bartolkaruza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bartolkaruza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bartolkaruza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bartolkaruza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bartolkaruza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bartolkaruza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c